#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This collection of Qiskit modules explores foundational quantum algorithms "
"like teleportation, key distribution, and Deutsch-Jozsa."
msgstr ""
"Koleksi modul Qiskit ini menerokai algoritma kuantum asas seperti "
"teleportasi, pengedaran kunci, dan Deutsch-Jozsa."

