#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This collection of Qiskit in-classroom modules is designed for an "
"undergraduate-level course in computer science, quantum computing, or "
"introductory quantum mechanics. The goal is to help educators and students "
"leverage quantum computers to experimentally explore foundational quantum "
"protocols and algorithms, such as quantum teleportation, quantum key "
"distribution (QKD), and the Deutsch-Jozsa and Bernstein-Vazirani "
"algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Koleksi modul dalam bilik darjah Qiskit ini direka untuk kursus peringkat "
"ijazah sarjana muda dalam sains komputer, pengkomputeran kuantum, atau "
"mekanik kuantum pengantar. Tujuannya adalah untuk membantu pendidik dan "
"pelajar memanfaatkan komputer kuantum bagi meneroka secara eksperimen "
"protokol dan algoritma kuantum asas, seperti teleportasi kuantum, pengedaran"
" kunci kuantum (QKD), serta algoritma Deutsch-Jozsa dan Bernstein-"
"Vazirani.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each module should be started in class with group and instructor support, "
"but can be completed independently or in small groups. All activities can be"
" completed in much less time than the free time allotted as part of the Open"
" Plan available to all users. Simulator options are also built-in in case "
"students accidentally exhaust their free quantum computing time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap modul seharusnya dimulakan di dalam kelas dengan sokongan kumpulan "
"dan pengajar, tetapi boleh disiapkan secara bebas atau dalam kumpulan kecil."
" Semua aktiviti boleh diselesaikan dalam masa yang jauh lebih singkat "
"daripada masa percuma yang diperuntukkan sebagai sebahagian daripada Pelan "
"Terbuka yang tersedia untuk semua pengguna. Pilihan simulator juga "
"disediakan sekiranya pelajar tersalah habiskan masa pengkomputeran kuantum "
"percuma mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instructors can request versions of these notebooks with answer keys and "
"guidance on placement in common curricula by filling out this [quick "
"survey](https://ibm.biz/classrooms_instructor_key_request) on how the "
"notebooks are being used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengajar boleh meminta versi buku nota ini dengan kunci jawapan dan panduan "
"penempatan dalam kurikulum biasa dengan mengisi [tinjauan "
"ringkas](https://ibm.biz/classrooms_instructor_key_request) ini tentang cara"
" buku nota digunakan.\n"

