msgid ""
"Some Python familiarity, though most notebooks can simply be run as "
"written\n"
msgstr ""
"Sedikit kebiasaan dengan Python, walaupun kebanyakan buku nota boleh terus "
"dijalankan seperti yang ditulis\n"
